<title>SPAIN: Repsol details employee offer request.</title>
<headline>Repsol details employee offer request.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish energy group Repsol said on Friday the total demand for employee and pensioner shares in that tranche of the group's final privatisation was valued at 48.46 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>The number of people requesting shares was 8,548, Respsol said in a statement. The number of share requests revoked was 53 for a value of 234 million pesetas.</p>
<p>The government is selling its last 10 percent stake in the energy blue chip this month in an offer that closes today. On Monday, the price of the offer will be fixed. The price cannot exceed the maximum 6,327 pesetas set on April 21.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
